contributions.contribution:
A read-only, independent assessment of the full original outcome. It covers:
- the exact corrected CLI;
- the four authored assets and how well they correspond to their sources and predecessors;
- whether the supplied verifiers are adequate;
- whether the execution plan matches the fixed commands;
- current C2 execution evidence (stdout, exit 0, >= 2 passes, 0 failures);
- the consequential revision: the baseline failure stays historical and the correction follows from it.

It uses the oracle rubric. Unmet and indeterminate criteria are kept.

